{
  "$schema": "../../templates/libs-catalog.schema.json",
  "stackId": "angular-universal",
  "category": "fullstack",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "buildSystem": "npm",
  "manifest": {
    "files": [
      "workspace/src/{AppName}/package.json",
      "workspace/src/{AppName}/angular.json",
      "workspace/src/{AppName}/tsconfig.json",
      "workspace/src/{AppName}/server.ts"
    ]
  },
  "metadata": {
    "platforms": [
      "node-22"
    ],
    "framework": "Angular 19 + @angular/ssr (Express integre)",
    "workflow": "single-project-ssr-hydration",
    "notes": "Standalone components + signals. Build produit dist/{AppName}/browser/ + dist/{AppName}/server/. SSR Express bootstrappe par @angular/ssr.",
    "lastUpdated": "2026-09-02",
    "changeLog": [
      "2026-09-02 — Audit fullstack. Rebase npm complet (Angular 19 -> 22.1.4). COUPLE MSAL realigne : `@azure/msal-angular` 6.2.0 declare le peer `@azure/msal-browser: ^5.20.0` ; le catalog associait msal-angular 4.0.3 a msal-browser 4.0.0. Ces deux paquets se bumpent ENSEMBLE. Express reste sur la ligne 4 (4.22.2), comme backend/node-express — cf. sa 2.3. TypeScript pinne 6.0.3 et non 7.0.2.",
      "2026-09-02 (rectificatif du meme audit) — CORRECTION DE COHERENCE. Le premier passage avait monte ce stack d'une MAJEURE. C'est incoherent avec la politique appliquee aux autres stacks 🟢 du meme audit (backend/kotlin-spring-boot reste en 3.5.x face a Spring Boot 4.1.1, backend/node-express reste en 4.x face a Express 5.2.1) : une majeure invalide la validation runtime qui porte le badge, et aucun bench ne peut etre re-joue ici. Le stack est donc ramene sur le DERNIER PATCH de sa majeure en place. La montee de majeure reste disponible en tache dediee, avec re-bench. Angular reste sur la ligne 19 (19.2.25) — trois majeures separent la 19 de la 22, le bench a tourne sur la 19. Le couple MSAL reste realigne DANS sa majeure : msal-angular 4.1.1 + msal-browser 4.30.0 (le catalog associait 4.0.3 a 4.0.0 ; ces deux paquets se bumpent ensemble, c'etait le vrai defaut)."
    ]
  },
  "versions": {
    "angular": "19.2.25",
    "express": "4.22.2",
    "rxjs": "7.8.2",
    "zod": "4.5.4",
    "typescript": "5.9.3",
    "zone-js": "0.16.2",
    "ngx-translate-core": "16.0.4",
    "ngx-translate-http": "16.0.1",
    "msal-angular": "4.1.1",
    "msal-browser": "4.30.0",
    "eslint": "10.9.1",
    "angular-eslint": "19.8.1",
    "prisma": "7.10.0",
    "prisma-client": "7.10.0",
    "tailwindcss": "4.3.3",
    "postcss": "8.5.26",
    "ngrx-signals": "19.2.1",
    "undici": "7.29.0",
    "exceljs": "4.4.0",
    "pdfmake": "0.2.15",
    "nodemailer": "6.10.1",
    "date-fns": "4.4.0",
    "ng2-charts": "7.0.0"
  },
  "core": [
    {
      "module": "@angular/core",
      "ref": "angular"
    },
    {
      "module": "@angular/common",
      "ref": "angular"
    },
    {
      "module": "@angular/router",
      "ref": "angular"
    },
    {
      "module": "@angular/forms",
      "ref": "angular"
    },
    {
      "module": "@angular/platform-browser",
      "ref": "angular"
    },
    {
      "module": "@angular/platform-browser-dynamic",
      "ref": "angular"
    },
    {
      "module": "@angular/ssr",
      "ref": "angular",
      "rationale": "SSR engine (Express)"
    },
    {
      "module": "@angular/material",
      "ref": "angular",
      "rationale": "UI Design System defaut"
    },
    {
      "module": "@angular/cdk",
      "ref": "angular"
    },
    {
      "module": "@angular/animations",
      "ref": "angular"
    },
    {
      "module": "express",
      "ref": "express",
      "rationale": "Server bootstrappe par @angular/ssr"
    },
    {
      "module": "rxjs",
      "ref": "rxjs"
    },
    {
      "module": "zod",
      "ref": "zod",
      "rationale": "Validation schemas (server + client)"
    },
    {
      "module": "typescript",
      "ref": "typescript"
    },
    {
      "module": "zone.js",
      "ref": "zone-js",
      "rationale": "Change detection (deprecate progressif vers signals, reste CORE en v19)"
    },
    {
      "module": "@ngx-translate/core",
      "ref": "ngx-translate-core"
    },
    {
      "module": "@ngx-translate/http-loader",
      "ref": "ngx-translate-http"
    },
    {
      "module": "@azure/msal-angular",
      "ref": "msal-angular",
      "rationale": "Auth Azure AD (selon ## Active Auth Specs)"
    },
    {
      "module": "@azure/msal-browser",
      "ref": "msal-browser"
    },
    {
      "module": "eslint",
      "ref": "eslint"
    },
    {
      "module": "@angular-eslint/builder",
      "ref": "angular-eslint"
    }
  ],
  "onDemand": [
    {
      "module": "prisma",
      "ref": "prisma",
      "capability": "prisma",
      "triggers": [
        "DatabaseType.*\\b(SqlServer|PostgreSql|MySql|Sqlite)\\b",
        "orm",
        "db-first"
      ]
    },
    {
      "module": "@prisma/client",
      "ref": "prisma-client",
      "capability": "prisma",
      "triggers": [
        "prisma",
        "orm"
      ]
    },
    {
      "module": "tailwindcss",
      "ref": "tailwindcss",
      "capability": "tailwind",
      "triggers": [
        "tailwind",
        "atomic.*css"
      ]
    },
    {
      "module": "postcss",
      "ref": "postcss",
      "capability": "tailwind",
      "triggers": [
        "tailwind"
      ]
    },
    {
      "module": "@ngrx/signals",
      "ref": "ngrx-signals",
      "capability": "signals-store",
      "triggers": [
        "ngrx",
        "store.*signal",
        "state-mgmt"
      ]
    },
    {
      "module": "undici",
      "ref": "undici",
      "capability": "http-client",
      "triggers": [
        "appel.*api.*externe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "module": "exceljs",
      "ref": "exceljs",
      "capability": "excel",
      "triggers": [
        "\\bexcel\\b",
        "\\.xlsx\\b",
        "export.*excel"
      ]
    },
    {
      "module": "pdfmake",
      "ref": "pdfmake",
      "capability": "pdf",
      "triggers": [
        "\\bpdf\\b",
        "export.*pdf"
      ]
    },
    {
      "module": "nodemailer",
      "ref": "nodemailer",
      "capability": "smtp",
      "triggers": [
        "email",
        "smtp"
      ]
    },
    {
      "module": "date-fns",
      "ref": "date-fns",
      "capability": "date-utils",
      "triggers": [
        "dates.*format"
      ]
    },
    {
      "module": "ng2-charts",
      "ref": "ng2-charts",
      "capability": "charts",
      "triggers": [
        "graph",
        "chart",
        "visualisation"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
